"title_0" = "The most important thing in your path right now is";
"title_1" = "Your mind, consciousness, logical thinking";
"title_2" = "Subconscious, Attraction, Desires";
"title_3" = "External, how you are perceived";
"title_4" = "Awareness of the situation";
"title_5" = "Which emotion should I follow";
"title_6" = "Outer, how should you treat others";

"fool_financial" = "The card indicates that you are embarking on a new life path and the roads are open for you. You are a very inquisitive and open person and are ready for any innovations and opportunities for this period. Use this state to your advantage. You can choose absolutely any direction that resonates with your soul, and this direction has every chance of great prospects. The card may also hint that it is time to work through your carelessness, irresponsibility and impulsiveness and take a more balanced attitude towards life, without committing too spontaneous actions. Your naivete and innocence can let others fool you.";
"magicianCard_financial" = "You are characterized by originality and creativity, intelligence, quick wits, an active life position, an independent spirit, willpower, self-confidence, the ability to control your own actions and influence other people, and the determination to see things through to the end. You know no fear and your awareness and inner strength will lead you to success. At this time, you have the position of the Creator of your own being, and practically everything is subject to you.";
"highpriestessCard_financial" = "The high priestess points to you as someone who has secrets. You can have access to esoteric and spiritual knowledge and be guided by it in life. You quickly grasp the deep meaning of what is happening, its background and spiritual purpose. In the aspect of personal growth, the card can mark the period of time in which knowledge is revealed to you that was previously inaccessible and incomprehensible to you.";
"empressCard_financial" = "The Empress symbolizes the progress of the feminine in you, regardless of your gender, about personal growth in this vein. Moreover, this is an active, creative, active feminine principle, radiating the energy of creation. This is the development of the wisdom of your body and emotionality, sensuality, the ability to love and be loved. There may also be a flourishing of your physical beauty.";
"emperorCard_financial" = "You have been given great realizing power over earthly events. You may not have a high position, no obvious resources, no noticeable position, but events still develop according to your will, shaping the end result. You are a self-confident person and your determination will give you excellent realization.";
"hierophantCard_financial" = "You are very filled with life experience, and therefore are able to give invaluable advice in the most incomprehensible situations. You are an empathic and wise mentor. Therefore, you should think about transferring your valuable experience to other people, you can actually be of great benefit to humanity.";
"lovesCard_financial" = "This card indicates your desire for the fullness of life, a time of contentment, harmony and balance, the unification of the masculine and feminine qualities of your nature. The time has come to make a decision that can torment you for a long time and decide on the choice of the further path of your development. And also the card can say that you are embraced by a sensual sphere and are in love. Try to add a little sanity to the flight of your soul, so that you can correctly direct your state and not mess things up.";
"chariotCard_financial" = "Your plans have true scope and you are moving towards your goals. You are a brave and ambitious person. The course you have chosen is right and you will get impressive results if you do not turn off the intended path.";
"strengthCard_financial" = "The card indicates that most likely you are a loner and overcome life circumstances with your stamina and determination. You must persevere, even if it hurts - this is your wise approach to solving problematic moments.";
"hermitCard_financial" = "You have to work with your own soul, reflection and deep introspection in solitude, the search for loneliness for inner work on yourself. It's time to be true to your own soul and find the purpose it came here for.";
"wheelOfFortune_financial" = "The card speaks of your ability to act boldly and sometimes unpredictably, relying not only on calculation, but also on luck. You have such interesting qualities as lightness, courage, activity and cheerfulness, and, as a rule, you hit right on target. Your life looks rich and interesting, and you can appear to others as the favorite of Fortune and the darling of fate due to your open and positive attitude towards life and the world in general.";
"justiceCard_financial" = "According to this card, there is an inclination towards truth and norms, it speaks of following them in spite of opposition, personal inclinations and desires, objectivity and decency. You are able to make a really right decision and not succumb to any delusions.";
"hangedCard_financial" = "The Hanged Man speaks of your being in a period of self-definition, crisis, sacrificing the old ego and being in a flow state that entails deep introspection. According to this card, you can say that at some point in your life you have reached a dead end and you feel that you cannot change the circumstances now. This state should not frighten you, this is an important period in which you will be able to understand where you sacrificed your personal self to humanity and, having learned life lessons, straighten the course of your destiny into development and your personal growth.";
"deathCard_financial" = "Another stage of your life is coming to an end, and a completely new personality is maturing inside you, renewed. Now your way of thinking, beliefs, feelings and reactions are changing. This is the very moment when you can become a different person, but at the same time remain yourself, but already in a transformed and improved state. You will have new hobbies, a new value system, new friends and acquaintances. Changes will take place not only within you, but also around you.";
"moderationCard_financial" = "You are in harmony with yourself and calmly perceive what is happening. This card corresponds to that happy state when you feel good, love yourself and are in harmonious balance with the world around you. This card corresponds to peace of mind. Serenity Moderation releases from pain, anxiety, fear.";
"devilCard_financial" = "According to this card, you can have quite evil intentions - to take revenge, kidnap, seduce or even kill, and you may not think about the future consequences at all. You may constantly be tempted to succumb to the temptation to cross all norms and rules, as in principle the voice of your soul. Be careful with this - the consequences will cost you dearly. Also, the card may indicate a feeling of fear or even cowardice and you need to look him in the face.";
"towerCard_financial" = "You have a very restless and explosive nature. Something can happen to you all the time. You are a person who is always ready to take risks and change. This card can also describe rude people, brawlers, criminals, stubborn people who challenge. According to this card, your energy can be destructive. Also, this card can indicate to you severe nervous breakdowns and mental disorders. Measures should be taken to balance yourself and direct your energy in a positive direction.";
"starCard_financial" = "You are a very talented person with good creative abilities. You are confidently moving towards your goals, even if they seem to others unrealistic and unpromising. You may have good intuition, you are the owner of inner wisdom. You are quite altruistic and always ready to help others. You can probably do spiritual practices, meditation, yoga, or the card wants to recommend it to you.";
"moonCard_financial" = "You can be a rather secretive person, keep many secrets in yourself and surround yourself with illusions. There can be a lot of gossip and conjectures about you, but you never know for sure whether they should be believed. The moon can also indicate that you may be escaping from reality with the help of alcohol, drugs, strong medications, gambling or Internet addiction. You may be prone to hidden fears, fears, increased anxiety.";
"sunCard_financial" = "You are a very bright, joyful, kind and generous person. Your activity, energy, and sincere desire and willingness to help other people allow you to build excellent communications and go to success. You can be creative and know how to attract interested looks, you can be the real soul of the company. Your psychological state in today's period of time is in perfect order and you can experience cloudless happiness.";
"doomsdayCard_financial" = "You are quite a talented person who has found inner freedom. You have many interests, you are a fairly happy person, and you may not have any addictions. Even if there were some dubious or difficult situations in your past, you successfully coped with them, or you are coping now and becoming a completely different, renewed person. You are now experiencing healing.";
"worldCard_financial" = "If we talk about the state of structure and balance in your personality, the World can tell you that it's time to start something new. It is by completing the old life cycle and starting a new one that you will answer many of your questions and gain integrity, which will help you reach your own destiny of your soul. Don't worry if you don't have the funds or experience to start this new business. By doing this, there will be people who will provide you with the necessary assistance. It is important for you not to be afraid and to be ready to overcome difficulties and use innovative approaches.";

//Figure

"pageOfPentacles_financial" = "This card indicates your good ability to learn and perceive, the ability to cope with all the troubles on your own. In some cases, the card indicates good material opportunities for your development, work and activity, help from the teacher and loved ones, the emergence of independence.";
"pageOfSwords_financial" = "After going through a period of doubt and self-esteem, you are now ready to act. This card indicates that you are ready to part with past illusions, get rid of obsessions and are able to start everything from scratch.";
"pageOfWands_financial" = "The card advises you to closely follow the news and information that comes to you. Soon you can meet a person who will change something in your worldview or give you an interesting idea. Don't shut yourself off from other people's offers of help. Get ready for something new and exciting. Your charisma and inner fire will help you grow above yourself.";
"pageOfCups_financial" = "You have overcome obstacles and can see things in a new light. Remain open to help from other people - especially young people. This is a good time to focus on a specific emotional issue, and this focus will help your personal growth.";
"knightOfPentacles_financial" = "You are a rather optimistic and patient person, with a sufficient measure of fortitude and concentration. You need to learn how to properly allocate your time and energy resources, show endurance, endurance and perseverance, regardless of the circumstances around you. The card carries for you a good potential for organization and hard work. You may not know how to choose specific goals for yourself, but you need to develop consistency and steady determination in yourself. You need to learn to set boundaries so that external circumstances do not distract you from your plans.";
"knightOfSwords_financial" = "The Knight of Swords marks the time for you to acknowledge and confront the destructive aspects of your love life and your relationships. Be patient and wait a little more before moving on. You will have to make efforts to grow above yourself and establish yourself in society and your positions.";
"knightOfWands_financial" = "The Knight of Wands speaks of a very active lifestyle. Enthusiasm, energy, enterprise come to you, you boldly move to all four sides and bravely meet any events and turns.";
"knightOfCups_financial" = "The card indicates your kindness, generosity, mercy and desire to help others. But at the same time, it also speaks of an unwillingness to take responsibility, a passion for one's fantasies and dreams. The card does not speak of opportunities for personal or spiritual growth in the near future, but only indicates a certain state in a given period of time.";
"kingOfPentacles_financial" = "You are a successful and reliable person, but from time to time you are so involved in business matters that your personal relationships can suffer from it. You need to learn how to balance the needs of friends and family with your innate ability to successfully manage your business, career, and any financial ventures you contemplate.";
"kingOfSwords_financial" = "The King of Swords means a period of learning and assimilation for you. You need to focus on cognition, accumulation of information, conducting scientific and methodological work. You need to hone your mind so that with its help you can understand your problems, in yourself and in the world around you. The main thing here is to strive for objectivity, to find a certain formula, an idea that underlies everything. Your decisions must be made through consistent logical reasoning, rational analysis.";
"kingOfWands_financial" = "The King of Wands may indicate your leadership qualities and desire to conquer mountains. You are quite purposeful, wise and courageous person. If you master the skill of concentration and concentration, your business will go faster. The card also advises turning to authority in the discipline being studied.";
"kingOfCups_financial" = "You need to eliminate the outdated way of thinking and develop your self-knowledge. Once you manage your emotions, you will gain the ability to think sensibly and decisively.";
"queenOfPentacles_financial" = "You are always ready to serve others, but sometimes your help and devotion are taken for granted. Pay attention to your needs and focus on your priorities.";
"queenOfSwords_financial" = "You want to transform sadness into wisdom, but in doing so, you allow your intellect to overwhelm your emotions. In your approach to life, you need to give free rein to your intuition, allowing the intellect to play only an intermediary function.";
"queenOfWands_financial" = "Explore the sources of your own power and set your own limits. Be calm about your emotional needs. You are already in contact with the feminine aspects of your personality and recognize them as a source of inspiration.";
"queenOfCups_financial" = "Insight comes from within, and it's important for you to remain an open person to receive inspiration from a deeper source. However, you should be astute so that you are not distracted by unrealistic desires.";

//Numeral

"aceOfPentacles_financial" = "The card says that success is in your hands, and the future fate depends only on your actions. After all, no one else will put your life in order, will not establish the necessary connections and will not go this way. Therefore, in no case should you allow stagnation, sit in one place, you need to act.";
"aceOfSwords_financial" = "The Ace is a double-edged sword, so in this situation you must evaluate your personal power and strength in a global sense and not remain double-minded. Learn to respond intellectually and emotionally to the world around you. This means that you must develop your discernment to such an extent that you are able to harmonize elements that may at first appear to be opposed to you.";
"aceOfWands_financial" = "The Ace of Wands characterizes a very active person with huge energy capabilities and potential. You not only get a good income, but also love what you do. There are always a lot of different ideas in your head, you strive to realize all of them. If your situation today is not so stable and rosy, then get ready - life will give you the opportunity to bring everything to the result that suits you.";
"aceOfCups_financial" = "You must go beyond your selfish concerns in order to realize your true spiritual potential. Spirit nourishes all things. Open to this higher wisdom and take it into your heart.";
"twoOfPentacles_financial" = "The appearance of the Two of Pentacles in the alignment regarding the direction of self-development suggests that you need to find harmony between spirituality and the material side of life. Excessive immersion in one area of ​​activity can negatively affect the quality of life in general. Personality should develop harmoniously, so you need to put things in order in this matter.";
"twoOfSwords_financial" = "In the layouts associated with self-development, the appearance of this minor lasso indicates doubts and hesitation that prevent a person from achieving success. This is a sign that the time has come to decide and make a choice. Achieving inner harmony is the only way to success. Now is the time to hear the voice of your heart and open the hidden corners of your soul.";
"twoOfWands_financial" = "The card indicates your desire to become someone important, but you are looking for the sources of inner energy. The duality of the map allows you to see a complex picture of the future through personal growth. Self-affirmation through a close environment is not desirable, because the appearance that you wear in public is far from your true essence. Courage will appear in you only if you fully realize your own destiny.";
"twoOfCups_financial" = "In matters of self-development and spiritual growth, this card personifies the acquisition of integrity and inner harmony. Harmonious relationships with other people are possible only when you have managed to deal with your experiences. The Two of Cups means the continuation of the spiritual development of the individual. At this stage, you learn to show and receive love, share your own mood and listen to your partner.";
"threeOfPentacles_financial" = "Your body, mind and spirit are united. You have mastered the skills you need and can move forward knowing that your peace of mind will help you achieve your goals. Continue to believe in the value of interaction and cooperation.";
"threeOfSwords_financial" = "From suffering comes wisdom and understanding. Love is possible only when honesty prevails in a relationship. Your feelings and the pain that you have experienced will help you grow above yourself.";
"threeOfWands_financial" = "Don't congratulate yourself on your success until you've tracked each step of your enterprise along the way to its completion. Prosperity requires a strong foundation. Use your abilities rightly and build your house on a solid foundation.";
"threeOfCups_financial" = "Find a way to share your happiness, love, and abundance. Joy can stem from past accomplishments, but it can also herald a happy and prosperous road ahead. In a joyful, playful manner, analyze your life and wait for new and pleasant chances.";
"fourOfPentacles_financial" = "The card indicates that everything will go as planned, and your goal will be achieved as planned and on time. Possible small overlays will be easily eliminated, since the position is completely controlled by you. If it was about work, the card can be interpreted as a stable position, quiet but reliable success, material well-being. She does not recommend changing jobs - you can expect success in an existing one. At the same time, the card indicates that in this situation you are only interested in the pragmatic, material side of the issue - it is unlikely that you will do something really significant.";
"fourOfSwords_financial" = "The Four of Swords is a card of meditation and spiritual practice. It also shows that you should temporarily forget about problems and grandiose plans for the future in order to indulge in the simple pleasures of life.";
"fourOfWands_financial" = "In between periods of fighting for your relationship, celebrate your positive accomplishments. Learn all you can from peace and stability. Be gentle, not aggressive - for there is strength in gentleness.";
"fourOfCups_financial" = "You need to reflect with others and alone on the decisions you make in your daily life. This requires patience and effort. If you don't, your life will remain static and lethargic and you will lose all sense of purpose and meaning.";
"fiveOfPentacles_financial" = "You can use your current adversity as an opportunity for personal growth. You may feel emotionally hurt or spiritually empty, but this is a turning point in your life. Whether you go forward with a more positive attitude is entirely up to you.";
"fiveOfSwords_financial" = "If you have just emerged victorious from a conflict situation, then what is the price of this victory? Was she won at the expense of others? If you have failed, what can be done to ensure that you are not exploited in the future?";
"fiveOfWands_financial" = "Even if you feel the pressure of increasing stress, tap into your inner reserves of strength and restore your clarity of thought. Respond to the challenge thrown to you and always look for new opportunities in the difficulties of everyday life.";
"fiveOfCups_financial" = "Sometimes you get so caught up in the feeling of loss that you forget that everything in life comes and goes. You must always strive to overcome regrets and remorse and have the courage to extract something useful from your shattered illusions. Be able to see new perspectives, get up and move on.";
"sixOfPentacles_financial" = "You should probably ask yourself if you are as generous to others as possible and if you are fair to yourself. Maybe you need to be kinder to others, as well as pay more attention to those parts of your personality that require more care and respect.";
"sixOfSwords_financial" = "You must make this journey. You have the strength and perseverance to achieve your goal. Aim for what you can achieve in the future.";
"sixOfWands_financial" = "Persistent efforts will be rewarded, but try not to be arrogant for too long and do not look down on others. Learn to accept contributions from others who are willing to support your work and ideas. Appreciate your friends.";
"sixOfCups_financial" = "Reflect on how your relationships and the lessons you have learned from life have enriched you. But after that, be ready to move on—we all have to emerge from the past, live in the present, and open up to what lies ahead.";
"sevenOfPentacles_financial" = "You probably suffer from low self-esteem: it seems to you that you are not talented enough, smart, efficient, professionally literate. This prevents you from setting high goals, because you, in your opinion, do not deserve them. At the same time, you are quite capable of mobilizing forces in yourself in time in order to persistently and persistently achieve results. You work hard because you are motivated by material things. You are almost never completely satisfied with the state, it always seems to you that you can achieve more, and you do it. Since you are seriously invested, you quite often look tired, emotionally and physically empty.";
"sevenOfSwords_financial" = "When you need to think about important things, do not allow yourself to shy away from the pressing issues. Calculate the consequences of your actions. Don't act hastily or impulsively. The Seven of Swords teaches you to adapt, quickly find solutions, be able to use non-banal methods to achieve your goals. The card says that sometimes the end justifies the means, so you can neglect some established traditions, but you need to do this only as necessary so that this attitude does not become a habit.";
"sevenOfWands_financial" = "Do not let others exploit you and trust your inner reserves - your creative energy and intuition. Sometimes we all need to stick to our beliefs. The time has come for you to show your perseverance, to go forward, despite any difficulties, without looking back, and without looking around. Self-improvement is achieved by hard work on oneself, by the determination to surpass oneself, by the desire to comprehend the laws of nature.";
"sevenOfCups_financial" = "We all have to make some kind of life choice. Learn to make decisions, get down from heaven and work hard to achieve your goals - otherwise you can get lost in a world of illusions and fantasies. The card characterizes a person as rather contradictory, slightly eccentric, overly dreamy, rushing about. Perhaps you do not know what you want at the moment, you have many plans and ideas, but they are all far from the realities of life. You have quite a powerful energy. You are active, full of ideas and desires, beautifully build castles in the air, believe in their reality and, thanks to your enthusiasm, make others believe in their reality. You have the ability to captivate and captivate.";
"eightOfPentacles_financial" = "The Eight of Pentacles teaches a lot, but the most important thing for you is patience and endurance. You can pass this lesson if you approach work on yourself with all responsibility. The card also teaches prudence and caution, and you have to determine for yourself the line between caution and fear.";
"eightOfSwords_financial" = "You are basing your plans on false assumptions and this will hinder your progress. Reassess the situation and ask yourself why you continue to act in the same manner. You need to explore other options, but make the final decision yourself. This card is directed towards the esoteric side of the path. Here it is very important for you to overcome your inner fears and blocks in order to release intuition imprisoned by consciousness in a labyrinth. Your inner gaze, intuition, will become a kind of Ariadne's thread on your way, but you need to try very hard to get this thread.";
"eightOfWands_financial" = "Wait patiently to see how things unfold, rather than rushing recklessly forward. When you are presented with different options, think carefully about all the consequences of your decisions so that these decisions are appropriate for specific situations. The Eight of Wands says that a moment of insight has come for you, which will lead to an expansion of consciousness. New horizons will suddenly open up for you, and, most importantly, you will be able to capture the essence of all incoming information, which is often hidden from understanding by others. With such a card, you are given some kind of freedom, including emotional. You should not close in on yourself, your path is that forward movement under the influence of surrounding circumstances. You must be prepared for the fact that some miracles can happen in your life. You need to take them for granted, without being afraid or running away from them.";
"eightOfCups_financial" = "Open up to new possibilities. Trust the guidance of a higher spiritual source. You will have to change internally in order to receive the opportunities that will open up for you along the way. You need to give up everything that attracted you in the past - from ideas, from hobbies, from addictions. Sometimes this refusal requires farewell to people and familiar places, but it is necessary. First of all, in order to accept the lesson, you must withdraw into yourself, say goodbye to your experiences and emotions. How you perceive them is another matter: you can feel lonely and detached, or you can enjoy introspection. The main thing is that you take a step. You need this transformation so that you can love in a new way and live in a new way. If the path is completed, the lesson learned, then you will enter the realm of satisfaction with your life.";
"nineOfPentacles_financial" = "The Nine of Pentacles indicates a person who is self-confident, calm and measured. Everything in your life is ordered, sorted out, and you yourself are in a state of bliss from your life. You are an aristocrat by nature, who prefers not to gush with emotions, but to thoroughly understand everything and find common ground with any person. You are the master of your life and everything that you have achieved with your own work. You are distinguished by rich life experience, wisdom in everyday matters. You know how to live beautifully and have the means to do so. You are not a spendthrift, but you are not accustomed to being content with little. You love everything luxurious, delicious, comfortable.";
"nineOfSwords_financial" = "If you are sad, then you must identify the source of your sadness, anger or shame, because it is holding you back. This is a time for self-evaluation. In the direction of self-development, the card shows you that it is time to fight the dark sides of your soul, which have transformed into fears and have taken over at the moment. You can't fight fear if it doesn't show its face. Right now, fear is coming out, tearing off its mask. You just have to defeat him.";
"nineOfWands_financial" = "Draw strength from your past hurts - from past emotional difficulties and hostile criticism. You will become even more inventive if you learn to cope with adversity. Trust the reserves of your strength and character, for this will help you cope with difficulties. The card invites you to turn to past experience, draw strength and knowledge from it, take into account the lessons of the past, analyze mistakes, and take successes into service. This will help you gain confidence and determination to move forward. The card teaches to persistently resist difficulties. It helps to understand that there is no real threat, and what you take for a threat is just memories from the past about the pain that mistakes brought. You need to tune in to change and say goodbye to the past, taking from it only the necessary baggage of experience. Everything must be done with a cold heart.";
"nineOfCups_financial" = "Although the card refers mainly to material happiness, it is important for you to remember that true happiness means meeting your emotional and spiritual needs. Continue to connect with your intuition, stay calm and relaxed, and open to the positive and creative potential that is unfolding in front of you in the present moment.";
"tenOfPentacles_financial" = "The Ten of Pentacles teaches you to accept with gratitude and even humility what is given without demanding anything else or more. She invites you to enjoy happiness and security, but do not put it at the forefront, because then you will be swallowed up by pride that prevents self-development. You need to remember one important detail. When you are happy, have reached the peak of your wealth and life experience, you should share this with others, because in an overflowing state you lose intrinsic motivation and stop on your way.";
"tenOfSwords_financial" = "The end is also the beginning. It is the end of one chapter of your life and the beginning of a new one. Before moving on, you need to let go of some of your old-fashioned, outdated views. In the direction of self-development, this card indicates that the time has come to reassess your ego. The way of thinking, inner fears, your own limitations have led you to the fact that the further path has become impossible for you. Nobody can change this but you. And you will have to change, because the circumstances are not developing in the best way for you, and if you leave everything as it was, the actual death for society will come - complete degradation.";
"tenOfWands_financial" = "Regardless of the burdens you carry alone in life, there are still times when it is good to seek advice and help from other people you trust. When your personal struggles seem overwhelming, reevaluate your life to make sure you're still on the right track.";
"tenOfCups_financial" = "The card means perfection and completeness, but it can also mean the beginning of some new cycle. Recognize the work that you and those around you have done so that you now feel joy and satisfaction with yourself, but remain open to new opportunities so that your happiness does not stop.";
